Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 09:19:31 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add classic CSS styling across the player UI, admin and
 maintenance pages

Styling only - no markup, PHP logic or JavaScript changed. The only edits to
existing files are one <link> line each in services/ui.php and the admin pages.

- assets/css/ihugure.css: player quiz UI (layered over Bootstrap 4.6.2) -
  night-blue stage, flag-colour ribbon, tappable answer tiles, gold/ghost
  buttons, styled countdown badge, reduced-motion and small-screen support
- assets/css/admin.css: admin pages (layered over Bootstrap 5.3.0 via its CSS
  variables) - table, pagination, filter bar, game detail, forms
- assets/css/admin-plain.css: framework-free admin/disable_user.php
- style.css: maintenance page (already linked by index.maintance.php)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013ogUcS39t5Zy6jcHAExUuc
